<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian Petroleum net up.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian Petroleum net up.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31.</p>
<p>		  (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			 104.86 vs 93.35</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 173.15 vs 161.07</p>
<p>    Gross sales (billion)	    6.84 vs 6.39</p>
<p>    Tax				   67.14 vs 67.15</p>
<p>NOTE: Australian Petroleum Pty Ltd (Ampol) is equally owned by Caltex Australia Ltd and Pioneer International Ltd. Caltex merged its petroleum retailing and refining operations with Ampol in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
</text>
